# Cross-origin isolation for multithreaded WebAssembly (wllama, ONNX Runtime Web).
# "require-corp", not "credentialless": Safari does not support "credentialless" and treats
# it as no policy, so the page was never isolated there. Model downloads are CORS fetches,
# which "require-corp" allows. Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
